      "writtenOn": "2024-10-08T15:56:41Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The next state should be RUN or GET_SINK_PDO, based on whether FRS is enabled.  When FRS is enabled, we always want to query the partner\u0027s SINK PDOs, even if we don\u0027t charge from the port.\n\n```\n\t\tif (IS_ENABLED(CONFIG_PLATFORM_EC_USB_PD_FRS) \u0026\u0026\n\t\t    port-\u003eccaps.op_mode_drp) {\n\t\t\tport-\u003esnk_attached_local_state \u003d\n\t\t\t\tSNK_ATTACHED_GET_SINK_PDO;\n\t\t} else {\n\t\t\tport-\u003esnk_attached_local_state \u003d SNK_ATTACHED_RUN;\n\t\t}\n```",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1992,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 1992,
        "endChar": 52
      },
      "revId": "01f2cc5b08139e5468206e6c6da1f9b974853fee",
